<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1705380883"/></metadata></head><body dur="4:29.093"><div begin="28.464" end="55.696" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="28.464" end="34.361" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="28.464" end="29.474">既然</span><span begin="29.474" end="29.718">你</span><span begin="29.718" end="30.137">想</span><span begin="30.137" end="30.643">分</span> <span begin="31.805" end="32.225">没有</span><span begin="32.225" end="32.657">理</span><span begin="32.657" end="33.099">由我</span><span begin="33.099" end="33.625">再苦</span><span begin="33.625" end="34.361">撑</span></p><p begin="35.663" end="41.076" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="35.663" end="36.655">我还</span><span begin="36.655" end="36.957">不</span><span begin="36.957" end="37.355">够</span><span begin="37.355" end="38.002">好</span> <span begin="38.002" end="38.422">抱</span><span begin="38.422" end="38.862">歉</span> <span begin="39.187" end="40.130">我不否</span><span begin="40.130" end="41.076">认</span></p><p begin="42.837" end="48.776" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="42.837" end="43.836">时间</span><span begin="43.836" end="44.140">一</span><span begin="44.140" end="44.547">晃</span><span begin="44.547" end="45.154">动</span> <span begin="46.224" end="46.480">记</span><span begin="46.480" end="47.362">忆就</span><span begin="47.362" end="47.664">模</span><span begin="47.664" end="48.049">糊</span><span begin="48.049" end="48.776">了</span></p><p begin="50.033" end="55.696" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="50.033" end="50.991">我们</span><span begin="50.991" end="51.245">的</span><span begin="51.245" end="51.686">爱</span><span begin="51.686" end="52.335">没</span><span begin="52.335" end="53.147">有防</span><span begin="53.147" end="54.241">手</span><span begin="54.241" end="55.696">震</span></p></div><div begin="56.870" end="1:09.529" itunes:songPart="PreChorus"><p begin="56.870" end="59.951" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="56.870" end="58.216">我很努力想着</span><span begin